      "text": "Once per reload, ally kills on targets previously hit by the Weapon or Kills on targets damaged by allies grant the following benefits:\n• Loads 66% of the Magazine Capacity (rounded up) into the weapon from reserves (this can overfill the Magazine)\n• Grants ? Reload Speed\n\nBows receive ?% decreased Draw Time instead of the above benefits.",
